#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 40
#: rc.cpp:271
msgid ""
"By default, the system tray icon indicates new incoming messages using an "
"animation. A left or middle mouse click on the icon will open the message in "
"a new chat window. Pressing the \"View\" button in the notification popup "
"has the same effect."
msgstr ""
"Standardwies warrt dat Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild animeert, wenn niege "
"Narichten ankaamt. En Links- oder Middelklick op dat Lüttbild oder en Klick "
"op den \"Ankieken\"-Knoop binnen den Opdukbescheed wiest de Naricht in en "
"nieg Klöönfinster."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 43
#: rc.cpp:274
msgid "Show system &tray icon"
msgstr "S&ysteemafsnitt-Lüttbild wiesen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 53
#: rc.cpp:277
msgid "Start with the main window minimized to the system tray"
msgstr "Bi't Starten warrt dat Hööftfinster na den Systeemafsnitt minimeert"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 56
#: rc.cpp:280
msgid ""
"Start with the main window hidden. The only visible item is the system tray "
"icon."
msgstr ""
"Mit versteken Hööftfinster starten, bloots dat Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild is "
"sichtbor."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 59
#: rc.cpp:283
msgid "Start &with hidden main window"
msgstr "Mit versteken &Hööftfinster starten"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 69
#: rc.cpp:286
msgid "Message Handling"
msgstr "Narichten-Hanteren"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 81
#: rc.cpp:289
msgid "Instantly open incoming messages"
msgstr "Ankamen Narichten fuurts opmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 84
#: rc.cpp:292
msgid ""
"If there is no chat window open, a new message arriving will cause a new "
"window to open. If there is already a chat window opened for that sender, "
"the message will immediately be displayed there."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat noch keen Klöönfinster gifft, warrt bi't Ankamen vun en nieg "
"Naricht en nieg Finster opmaakt. Wenn dat al en Finster för den Senner vun "
"de Naricht gifft, warrt de Naricht dor fuurts binnen wiest."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 87
#: rc.cpp:295
msgid "Open messages instantl&y"
msgstr "Narichten f&uurts opmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 94
#: rc.cpp:298
msgid "Use a message queue to store incoming messages"
msgstr "En Narichtenreeg för't Wohren vun ankamen Narichten bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 97
#: rc.cpp:301
msgid ""
"Store new incoming messages in a message queue. New messages are messages "
"that cannot be displayed in an already open chat window. Only queued or "
"stacked messages trigger notification via chat window and system tray icon "
"animations."
msgstr ""
"Nieg ankamen Narichten in en Narichtenreeg wohren. Nieg Narichten sünd de, "
"de sik nich binnen en al apen Klöönfinster wiesen laat. Bloots inreegte oder "
"stapelte Narichten lööst Bescheden över Klöönfinster un animeert "
"Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild ut."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 100
#: rc.cpp:304
msgid "Use message &queue"
msgstr "Narichten&reeg bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 107
#: rc.cpp:307
msgid "Use a message stack to store incoming messages"
msgstr "En Narichtenstapel för't Wohren vun ankamen Narichten bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 110
#: rc.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Store new incoming messages in a message stack. New messages are messages "
"that cannot be displayed in an already open chat window. Only queued or "
"stacked messages trigger notification via chat window and system tray icon "
"animations."
msgstr ""
"Nieg ankamen Narichten op en Narichtenstapel wohren. Nieg Narichten sünd de, "
"de sik nich binnen en al apen Klöönfinster wiesen laat. Bloots inreegte oder "
"stapelte Narichten lööst Bescheden över Klöönfinster oder animeert "
"Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild ut."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 113
#: rc.cpp:313
msgid "Use message stac&k"
msgstr "Narichtensta&pel bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 123
#: rc.cpp:316
msgid "Also add unread messages to queue/stack"
msgstr "Nich leeste Narichten ok na Narichtenreeg/-stapel tofögen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 126
#: rc.cpp:319
msgid ""
"Unread messages are messages that will be displayed in an already opened but "
"inactive chat window. Only incoming queued messages trigger notification via "
"chat window and system tray icon animations. With this option disabled only "
"new incoming messages are queued, i.e. messages that cannot be displayed in "
"an already open chat window."
msgstr ""
"Nich leest Narichten sünd de, de in en al apen, man nich anmaakt "
"Klöönfinster wiest warrt. Bloots inreegte oder stapelte ankamen Narichten "
"lööst Bescheden över Klöönfinster oder animeert Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild ut. "
"Is dit utmaakt, warrt bloots nieg ankamen Narichten inreegt; dat sünd "
"Narichten, de sik nich binnen en al apen Klöönfinster wiesen laat."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui line 129
#: rc.cpp:322
msgid "Queue/stack unrea&d messages"
msgstr "&Nich leeste Narichten inregen/stapeln"

